    78	        f"BALANCES: Each agent has its own balance of {v['unit']}. {v['balance']}\n"
    79	        f"SPENDING: Every token an agent generates, thinking included, takes one {v['one']} from that agent's own "
    80	        f"balance. Reading costs nothing.{free}\n"
    81	        f"TRANSFERS move {v['unit']} from one agent in the session to another; nothing is lost.\n"
    82	        f"AT ZERO {v['unit'].upper()}: {v['zero']} This holds however the balance reaches zero.\n\n"
