I reproduced the transfer-order problem: with balances of 10 each and reciprocal gifts of 10, whichever agent transfers first dies; reversing the order reverses the death. The code also lets an agent choose STAY with zero solve allowance and still supply its clue. That can be useful cooperation, but it makes “stayed” a poor measure of task effort.

